translate_official_item.user_template:
Translate the source text below into Turkish.

Rules:
- Preserve the factual tone of the original source, whether it is official, media, social, OSINT or analysis.
- Do not summarize.
- Do not write 'özet'.
- Keep direct factual wording.
- If the text is short, translate it fully. If it is long, keep the most important body text faithfully, without commentary.
- Translate by meaning and context, never by blind word replacement. Preserve proper names and abbreviations such as U.S., US and Iranian when uncertain; never alter substrings inside words such as warning.

SOURCE NAME: {source_name}
TITLE: {title}
TEXT: {text}
LINK: {link}

Return compact JSON with keys: title_tr, text_tr.
